                {
                    "id": "engineering",
                    "topic": "engineering",
                    "basis": "interpretation",
                    "text": "同步锁存避免同进程事件并发触发，绝对SystemRoot路径降低PATH歧义；弹窗只负责取消而不再次安排也清晰。关键维护点是持久复位必须成为外部动作前置条件，错误日志不能替代阻断。 源码依据：[lib/index.js](https://github.com/873360545/dsh-auto-shutdown/blob/a2af408455e31a0acf4021e3383d1384dcb7aebc/lib/index.js)、[lib/popup.js](https://github.com/873360545/dsh-auto-shutdown/blob/a2af408455e31a0acf4021e3383d1384dcb7aebc/lib/popup.js)、[assets/notify.ps1](https://github.com/873360545/dsh-auto-shutdown/blob/a2af408455e31a0acf4021e3383d1384dcb7aebc/assets/notify.ps1)、[lib/client.js](https://github.com/873360545/dsh-auto-shutdown/blob/a2af408455e31a0acf4021e3383d1384dcb7aebc/lib/client.js)。",
                    "evidence_ids": [
                        "2026-10-21-03-github-1425073734-root-source"
                    ],
                    "dependencies": [
                        {
                            "plugin_id": "github:1425073734:root",
                            "area": "code",
                            "fingerprint": "a2af408455e31a0acf4021e3383d1384dcb7aebc"
                        }
                    ],
                    "reviewed_at": "2026-10-21T03:44:26.207Z",
                    "status": "current"
                },
                {
                    "id": "contribution",
                    "topic": "technical_innovation",
                    "basis": "interpretation",
                    "text": "相对人工守候后关机，增量是将root轮次边界、单次锁存和原生取消窗口组合为可配置交接；系统关机命令是既有能力，插件贡献在触发条件与用户干预入口。",
                    "evidence_ids": [
                        "2026-10-21-03-github-1425073734-root-source"
                    ],
                    "dependencies": [
                        {
                            "plugin_id": "github:1425073734:root",
                            "area": "code",
                            "fingerprint": "a2af408455e31a0acf4021e3383d1384dcb7aebc"
                        }
                    ],
                    "reviewed_at": "2026-10-21T03:44:26.207Z",
                    "status": "current"
                },
                {
                    "id": "critical_question",
                    "topic": "limitations",
                    "basis": "interpretation",
                    "text": "“一次且重启不再触发”是否保证？disarm捕获settings写入错误后仍继续scheduleShutdown，持久开关可能仍为true；turn-stopping也不证明业务任务成功或待保存数据完成。fired只在当前进程防重复，不能把它当跨重启事务锁。",
                    "evidence_ids": [
                        "2026-10-21-03-github-1425073734-root-source"
                    ],
                    "dependencies": [
                        {
                            "plugin_id": "github:1425073734:root",
                            "area": "code",
                            "fingerprint": "a2af408455e31a0acf4021e3383d1384dcb7aebc"
                        }
                    ],
                    "reviewed_at": "2026-10-21T03:44:26.207Z",
                    "status": "current"
                },
                {
                    "id": "innovation_hypothesis",
                    "topic": "technical_innovation",
                    "basis": "unverified",
                    "text": "由持久复位与外部关机分离推导，可在复位失败时停止安排关机，并将触发限定为用户选定会话与显式完成标记，保留可观察的计划ID。未验证假设是减少错误时机关机；模拟设置写失败、失败轮、其它应用未保存和重启，若仍出现未经条件满足的计划则否定。",
                    "evidence_ids": [
                        "2026-10-21-03-github-1425073734-root-source"
                    ],
                    "dependencies": [
                        {
                            "plugin_id": "github:1425073734:root",
                            "area": "code",
                            "fingerprint": "a2af408455e31a0acf4021e3383d1384dcb7aebc"
